(card "exp:anchor_g2_baseline" :type "experiment"
  :subj "exp:anchor_g2_baseline"
  :body "---\nnav: 0\ntype: experiment\nid: anchor_G2\nshort_name: baseline\ntitle: \"Anchor — G2 default (new-split SOTA reference baseline)\"\narc: 260516a\nteam: anchor\nround: anchor\nparent_arc: \"[[arcs/260516a]]\"\nparent_lineage: null\ntrain_nav: 2.1882\ntrain_trade_count: 140\ntrain_win_rate: 0.8571\ntrain_sharpe: 7.6980\ntrain_max_drawdown: -0.0101\nval_nav_mean: 1.0601\nval_nav_sigma: 0.0809\nval_window_count: 13\ntest_nav: 1.2486\ntest_trade_count: 20\ntest_sharpe: 7.1522\ntest_win_rate: 0.7500\ntest_max_drawdown: -0.0053\nanchor_train_nav: 2.1882\nanchor_test_nav: 1.2486\nstatus: anchor\noutcome: test_pass\nchampion: false\noverfit_score: 0\nleak_audit: clean\naxis: [baseline]\npast_only_window_days: null\nwarmup_required: null\ncreated: 2026-05-16T18:59:00\nlast_updated: 2026-05-17T01:50:00\ntags: [arc/260516a, team/anchor, round/anchor, axis/baseline, status/anchor, outcome/test_pass, leak/clean, size/medium]\n---\n\n# Anchor — G2 default (new-split SOTA reference baseline)\n\n> **TL;DR** —— alpha_second_v1 当前生产 SOTA（kernel_v3 G2 默认配置）在 arc 260516a 新 split 上的\"裸跑\"成绩。所有 candidate 必须严格胜过这一行才算 challenger / champion。**train NAV = 2.19, test NAV = 1.25**。\n\n## 假设 (Hypothesis)\n不是 hypothesis，是**参考点**。G2 是 kernel_v3 当前已 deploy 的 default config，commit `70c54eb`。arc 260516a 的全部 candidate 都以此为 anchor 做比较；ranking 主标尺 = 严格高的 NAV。\n\n## 实现 (Implementation)\n- G2 source: `/Users/han/project/alpha/alpha_second_v1/.worktrees/kernel_v3/experiments/g2_post_0209.py`\n- 跑法 script: `/Users/han/project/alpha/alpha_second_v1/arcs/all/260516a_agent_team_beat_current_sota/scripts/shared/run_anchor.py`\n- output 目录: `/Users/han/project/alpha/alpha_second_v1/arcs/all/260516a_agent_team_beat_current_sota/output/260516_1857_anchor/`\n- 关键 config（不动）：\n  - `baseline_max_avg` = 1,300,000\n  - `arbitrage_threshold` = 0.09\n  - `valid_threshold` = 0.04\n  - `horizon_seconds` = 65\n  - `fee` = 0.0003, `slippage` = 0.00148\n\n## Past-only window 处理\n- G2 默认不用 rolling stat。所有 admit 决策只看 t 时刻当下的 ratio / volume / leg 信息。**结构上没有 lookahead 风险**（critic 2026-05-16 audit pass）。\n\n## 结果 (Results)\n| | NAV | Trades | Sharpe | Win | MaxDD |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Train (seg1+seg2) | 2.1882 | 140 | 7.70 | 85.7% | -1.01% |\n| Val (rolling 13w mean ± σ) | 1.0601 ± 0.0809 | - | - | - | - |\n| Test (hold-out 2026-05-01 → 05-15, eff 05-08) | 1.2486 | 20 | 7.15 | 75.0% | -0.53% |\n\nTrain mean_return_per_trade = 0.5636% ⇒ implied gate \"anchor train mean + 1σ noise floor\" ≈ 0.807% per-trade val mean。\n\n## 风险 & overfit 嫌疑\n- N/A（这是 baseline，不存在 overfit 的概念）\n- 仅记录：train 笔数 140 给出了 candidate count gate 的中心点 (`140 ± 30%` = 100-180)。\n\n## Lineage（双链网）\n- **descendants** (直接以本 anchor 为对照基准的所有 candidate)：\n  - [[arc_260516a__team_h__H-R3b-4__c84_kelly_lambda_1.5]] ← 当前 SOTA challenger\n  - [[arc_260516a__team_h__H-R2-2__c84_linear_sizing]]\n  - [[arc_260516a__team_c__C8.4__top3_no_open3min_bypass]]\n  - [[arc_260516a__team_b__B-R8-1__no_open3min_bypass03]]\n  - [[arc_260516a__team_d__D-R2-3__blacklist_stack_triple]]\n  - [[arc_260516a__team_f__F-R1-1__ofi_drop_extreme]]\n  - [[arc_260516a__team_g__G-R1-1__luoyangchan_solo]]\n\n## Reports\n- `/Users/han/project/alpha/alpha_second_v1/arcs/all/260516a_agent_team_beat_current_sota/output/260516_1857_anchor/README.md`\n- [[arc_260516a__reporter_20260517_0547]]\n\n## Notes / 下次迭代\n- arc 260516a 给后续 anchor 留的 lessons：\n  1. **NAV 是 ranking 主标尺**，mean_return_per_trade 已降级为辅助 —— 下次开新 arc 直接以 NAV 排序，不要重蹈 mean-ranking 时代的尺度切换。\n  2. anchor 跑出来的 **val_nav_mean** 一定要算 13 个 rolling window，给 NAV gate 提供 σ；count gate 中心点取 anchor trade_count。\n  3. test 数据上限 effective_test_end (2026-05-08 in this arc) 一定要在 metadata 里显式记录，不能让 candidate test 数和 anchor test 数对不齐。\n"
